#indent 4

//: # check/module/memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_gate
//: `Eq` / `Hash` method body の `PrivateState` / `PrivateCache` effect を、Resource IR no-escape proof と照合してから method body fact table へ投入する checker-layer module です。
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - `PrivateState` / `PrivateCache` を pure evidence に近づけるには、method body の effect summary だけでは足りません。body origin、body root、operation、effect、元 escape state が一致する Resource proof が必要です。
//: - 既存 `SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact` は resolver 用の最終 fact であり、body root identity を保持しません。そのため、この module は fact table を後から補正せず、HIR root から fact を作る直前で proof を適用します。
//: - Drop body の `InternalAlloc` proof gate と private effect proof gate を混ぜず、PrivateState / PrivateCache 専用の proof table、duplicate rejection、placeholder rejection を固定します。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - proof key は `SelfhostTypeId`、operation、body module fingerprint、body root、effect、元 escape state の完全一致を要求します。`SelfhostTypeId` だけ、operation だけ、source span / display name / body hash だけの proof reuse は認めません。
//: - `body_module_fingerprint == 0` は placeholder origin なので proof record と identity-bearing input の両方で拒否します。module-local root id だけを proof key にしてはいけません。
//: - table build API は 1 つの `&SelfhostHirModule` と 1 つの `body_module_fingerprint` に閉じます。複数 module 由来の method body root を 1 回の呼び出しに混ぜず、module ごとに別々の proof gate 呼び出しへ分けます。
//: - proof lookup は `PrivateState + NotApplicable` または `PrivateCache + NotApplicable` のときだけ行います。`InternalAlloc`、`Pure`、`UnsafeMemory`、`ExternalIo`、`Nondet` はこの gate では proof lookup せず、そのまま既存 method body fact にします。
//: - matching proof が `Proven` の場合だけ `NoEscapeProven` を付与します。`Refuted` は `MayEscape` に写し、`Missing` / `Unknown` は元の `NotApplicable` のまま残します。未証明 private effect を pure に mask しません。
//: - 入力 summary がすでに private effect + `NoEscapeProven` の場合は `UnexpectedPreProvenNoEscape` として拒否します。この gate より前の boundary が no-escape を合成する bypass を認めません。
//: - 成功しても operation evidence、aggregate proof、memo_call backend bytes、sealed backend representation、artifact key、Resource proof production は作りません。返すのは既存 resolver が読める method body fact table owner だけです。
//:
//: [現状/げんじょう]:
//: - Phase 1 では、caller が渡した proof table と method body scan record から既存 fact table を作る checker-layer boundary です。actual Resource IR traversal が proof table を作る処理、memo_call backend mask、prechecked artifact 接続は後続 stage の責務です。
//: - facade にはまだ re-export しません。full public surface orchestration が private effect proof producer を消費する段階で公開範囲を再評価します。
//:
//: [計算量/けいさんりょう]:
//: - scan input 数を m、proof record 数を p、各 HIR root から到達する expression 数を n_i、child edge 数を e_i とすると、現状は O(m * p + Σ(n_i + e_i)) 時間です。
//: - proof lookup は現在 linear scan です。duplicate rejection と exact key contract を保てるなら、後続で sorted index / bucket に置き換えられます。
//:
//: neplg2:test[stdio, normalize_newlines]
//: stdout: mlstr:
//: ##: Checked [ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok]
//: ##: [0] ok
//: ##: [1] ok
//: ##: [2] ok
//: ##: [3] ok
//: ##: [4] ok
//: ##: [5] ok
//: ##: [6] ok
//: ##: [7] ok
//: ##: [8] ok
//: exit_code: 0
//: ```neplg2
//:| #entry main
//:| #target std
//:| #import "core/result" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/check/module/memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_gate" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/check/module/memo_trait_operation_purity_gate" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/ty/effect" as *
//:| #import "std/test" as *
//: fn main %impure fn void i32 \void:
//:     match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_gate_stage0:
//:         Result::Ok summary:
//:             let checks0 checks_new
//:             let checks1 checks_push checks0 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_gate_check_effect_eq summary.private_cache_proven_check SelfhostEffectKind::PrivateCache SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NoEscapeProven
//:             let checks2 checks_push checks1 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_gate_check_effect_eq summary.private_cache_missing_check SelfhostEffectKind::PrivateCache SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NotApplicable
//:             let checks3 checks_push checks2 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_gate_check_effect_eq summary.private_state_refuted_check SelfhostEffectKind::PrivateState SelfhostEffectEscapeState::MayEscape
//:             let checks4 checks_push checks3 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_gate_check_effect_eq summary.pure_pass_check SelfhostEffectKind::Pure SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NotApplicable
//:             let checks5 checks_push checks4 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_gate_check_effect_eq summary.internal_alloc_pass_check SelfhostEffectKind::InternalAlloc SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NotApplicable
//:             let checks6 checks_push checks5 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_gate_check_effect_eq summary.mismatched_root_check SelfhostEffectKind::PrivateCache SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NotApplicable
//:             let checks7 checks_push checks6 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_gate_check_effect_eq summary.mismatched_module_check SelfhostEffectKind::PrivateCache SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NotApplicable
//:             let checks8 checks_push checks7 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_gate_error_result_eq summary.duplicate_rejected SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind::ProofDuplicate
//:             let checks9 checks_push checks8 check selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_gate_fact_error_result_eq summary.preproven_rejected SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind::UnexpectedPreProvenNoEscape
//:             let shown checks_print_report checks9
//:             checks_exit_code shown
//:         Result::Err _setup:
//:             let checks0 checks_new
//:             let checks1 checks_push checks0 Result::Err "private effect no-escape gate stage0 setup failed"
//:             let shown checks_print_report checks1
//:             checks_exit_code shown
//: ```

#import "alloc/collections/vec" as v
#import "core/field" as field
#import "core/math" as *
#import "core/option" as *
#import "core/result" as *
#import "core/traits/copy" as *
#import "neplg2/core/hir/hir" as *
#import "neplg2/core/infra/span" as *
#import "neplg2/core/resolve/name_resolver" as *
#import "neplg2/core/ty/effect" as *
#import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/id" as *
#import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/memo_trait_operation_evidence" as *
#import "./memo_trait_operation_method_body_effect_checker" as *
#import "./memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_input_scan" as *
#import "./memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_producer" as *
#import "./memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_table_inputs" as *
#import "./memo_trait_operation_method_body_resolver" as *
#import "./memo_trait_operation_purity_gate" as *

//: SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey: private effect no-escape proof の照合 key
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `body_module_fingerprint` は module-local `SelfhostHirExprId` の origin token です。proof 成功そのものの根拠ではなく、別 module の同じ root index への proof reuse を防ぎます。
//: - `operation` を key に含めることで、同じ type / body root を別 operation の proof として流用する退行を防ぎます。
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey:
    type_id %SelfhostTypeId
    operation %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind
    body_module_fingerprint %i32
    body_root %SelfhostHirExprId
    effect %SelfhostEffectKind
    escape %SelfhostEffectEscapeState

//: SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus: Resource proof 由来の no-escape 判定
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `Proven` だけが `NoEscapeProven` になります。
//: - `Missing` / `Unknown` は accepted proof ではありません。fact は `NotApplicable` のまま残します。
pub enum SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus:
    Proven
    Refuted
    Missing
    Unknown

//: SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofRecord: 1 件の private effect proof record
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - record は proof store artifact ではなく session-local typed input です。
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofRecord:
    key %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey
    status %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus

//: SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofTable: private effect proof record の owner table
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `records` は owner buffer です。不要になったら `selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_table_free` で閉じます。
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofTable:
    records %Vec SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofRecord

//: SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind: private effect proof gate の拒否理由
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - proof table、input scan、effect checker、fact producer、output table の失敗箇所を bool や文字列へ潰さず typed enum として保持します。
pub enum SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind:
    ProofRecordPushFailed %StdErrorKind
    ProofBodyModuleFingerprintPlaceholder
    InputScanRejected %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFactInputScanErrorKind
    OutputTableAllocFailed %StdErrorKind
    InputReadFailed %i32
    EffectCheckRejected %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyEffectCheckerErrorKind
    FactProducerRejected %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFactProducerErrorKind
    ProofRecordReadFailed %i32
    ProofDuplicate
    UnexpectedPreProvenNoEscape
    OutputTableRejected %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyResolverErrorKind

//: SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateStage0Summary: private effect no-escape gate smoke の代表結果
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateStage0Summary:
    private_cache_proven_check %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind
    private_cache_missing_check %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind
    private_state_refuted_check %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind
    pure_pass_check %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind
    internal_alloc_pass_check %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind
    mismatched_root_check %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind
    mismatched_module_check %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind
    duplicate_rejected %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyCheck SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind
    preproven_rejected %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind

//: Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey: owner を含まない proof key を値として[複製/ふくせい]する
impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey \self:
        *self

//: Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey: proof key が owner lifecycle を持たないことを示す marker
impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofRecord:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofRecord SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofRecord \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofRecord:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofRecord SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofRecord \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateStage0Summary:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateStage0Summary SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateStage0Summary \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateStage0Summary:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateStage0Summary SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateStage0Summary \self:
        self

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_key_new: private effect proof key を[作/つく]る
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_key_new %fn SelfhostTypeId fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind fn i32 fn SelfhostHirExprId fn SelfhostEffectKind fn SelfhostEffectEscapeState SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey \type_id\operation\body_module_fingerprint\body_root\effect\escape:
    SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey type_id operation body_module_fingerprint body_root effect escape

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_record_new: private effect proof record を[作/つく]る
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_record_new %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofRecord \key\status:
    SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofRecord key status

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_table_new: [空/から]の proof table を[作/つく]る
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_table_new %impure fn void Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofTable StdErrorKind \void:
    let records_result %Result Vec SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofRecord StdErrorKind v::new
    match records_result:
        Result::Ok records:
            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofTable records
        Result::Err e:
            Result::Err e

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_table_free: proof table の owner buffer を[閉/と]じる
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_table_free %impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofTable unit \table:
    v::free field::get table "records"

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_table_len: proof record 数を[返/かえ]す
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_table_len %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofTable i32 \table:
    let records %&Vec SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofRecord field::get_ref table "records"
    v::len records

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_table_push: proof record を table に[追加/ついか]する
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `body_module_fingerprint == 0` は module origin を証明できない placeholder なので、proof table に保存せず fail-closed に拒否します。
//: - push 失敗時は `Vec` が返した owner を閉じ、typed error に変換します。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_table_push %impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofTable impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofRecord Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofTable SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind \table\record:
    if:
        eq record.key.body_module_fingerprint 0
        then:
            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_table_free table
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind::ProofBodyModuleFingerprintPlaceholder
        else:
            let records %Vec SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofRecord field::get table "records"
            match v::push records record:
                Result::Ok next_records:
                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofTable next_records
                Result::Err e:
                    let error %StdErrorKind field::get e "error"
                    v::free v::vec_push_error_vec e
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind::ProofRecordPushFailed error

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_escape_state_eq: escape state が同じ variant か[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_escape_state_eq %fn SelfhostEffectEscapeState fn SelfhostEffectEscapeState bool \a\b:
    match a:
        SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NotApplicable:
            match b:
                SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NotApplicable:
                    true
                SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NoEscapeProven:
                    false
                SelfhostEffectEscapeState::MayEscape:
                    false
        SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NoEscapeProven:
            match b:
                SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NotApplicable:
                    false
                SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NoEscapeProven:
                    true
                SelfhostEffectEscapeState::MayEscape:
                    false
        SelfhostEffectEscapeState::MayEscape:
            match b:
                SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NotApplicable:
                    false
                SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NoEscapeProven:
                    false
                SelfhostEffectEscapeState::MayEscape:
                    true

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_key_eq: proof key が同じ method body fact source を指すか[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_key_eq %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey bool \a\b:
    and:
        selfhost_type_id_eq a.type_id b.type_id
        and:
            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_evidence_kind_eq a.operation b.operation
            and:
                eq a.body_module_fingerprint b.body_module_fingerprint
                and:
                    eq selfhost_hir_expr_id_index a.body_root selfhost_hir_expr_id_index b.body_root
                    and:
                        selfhost_effect_kind_eq a.effect b.effect
                        selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_escape_state_eq a.escape b.escape

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_lookup_finish: lookup の最終状態を[畳/たた]む
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_lookup_finish %fn Option SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind \found:
    match found:
        Option::Some status:
            Result::Ok status
        Option::None:
            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus::Missing

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_lookup_loop: proof table から matching status を[探/さが]す
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - matching proof が 2 件以上ある場合は `ProofDuplicate` として拒否します。record order による first-wins は使いません。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_lookup_loop %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofTable fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey fn i32 fn Option SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind \proofs\key\idx\found:
    if:
        ge idx selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_table_len proofs
        then:
            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_lookup_finish found
        else:
            let records %&Vec SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofRecord field::get_ref proofs "records"
            match v::get records idx:
                Option::Some record:
                    if:
                        selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_key_eq record.key key
                        then:
                            match found:
                                Option::Some _existing:
                                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind::ProofDuplicate
                                Option::None:
                                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_lookup_loop proofs key add idx 1 some record.status
                        else:
                            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_lookup_loop proofs key add idx 1 found
                Option::None:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind::ProofRecordReadFailed idx

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_lookup_result: key に対応する proof status を[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_lookup_result %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofTable fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind \proofs\key:
    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_lookup_loop proofs key 0 none

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_fact_from_summary_result: summary を method body fact へ[写/うつ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_fact_from_summary_result %fn SelfhostTypeId fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyEffectSummary Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind \type_id\operation\summary:
    match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_from_summary_result type_id operation summary:
        Result::Ok fact:
            Result::Ok fact
        Result::Err producer_error:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind::FactProducerRejected producer_error

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_summary_with_escape: summary の escape だけを[差/さ]し[替/か]える
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_summary_with_escape %fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyEffectSummary fn SelfhostEffectEscapeState SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyEffectSummary \summary\escape:
    SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyEffectSummary summary.effect escape

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_escape_from_status: proof status を escape state へ[写/うつ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_escape_from_status %fn SelfhostEffectEscapeState fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus SelfhostEffectEscapeState \original\status:
    match status:
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus::Proven:
            SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NoEscapeProven
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus::Refuted:
            SelfhostEffectEscapeState::MayEscape
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus::Missing:
            original
        SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofStatus::Unknown:
            original

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_transform_private_summary_result: private effect summary を proof で[更新/こうしん]する
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_transform_private_summary_result %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofTable fn SelfhostTypeId fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind fn i32 fn SelfhostHirExprId fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyEffectSummary Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind \proofs\type_id\operation\body_module_fingerprint\body_root\summary:
    if:
        eq body_module_fingerprint 0
        then:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind::ProofBodyModuleFingerprintPlaceholder
        else:
            match summary.escape:
                SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NotApplicable:
                    let key %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofKey selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_key_new type_id operation body_module_fingerprint body_root summary.effect summary.escape
                    match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_proof_lookup_result proofs key:
                        Result::Ok status:
                            let next_escape %SelfhostEffectEscapeState selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_escape_from_status summary.escape status
                            let next_summary %SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyEffectSummary selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_summary_with_escape summary next_escape
                            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_fact_from_summary_result type_id operation next_summary
                        Result::Err e:
                            Result::Err e
                SelfhostEffectEscapeState::NoEscapeProven:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind::UnexpectedPreProvenNoEscape
                SelfhostEffectEscapeState::MayEscape:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_fact_from_summary_result type_id operation summary

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_transform_summary_result: effect summary を private proof gate へ[通/とお]す
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `PrivateState` / `PrivateCache` だけが proof lookup の対象です。
//: - それ以外の effect は、この gate では escape state を変更しません。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_transform_summary_result %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofTable fn SelfhostTypeId fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind fn i32 fn SelfhostHirExprId fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyEffectSummary Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFact SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind \proofs\type_id\operation\body_module_fingerprint\body_root\summary:
    if:
        eq body_module_fingerprint 0
        then:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind::ProofBodyModuleFingerprintPlaceholder
        else:
            match summary.effect:
                SelfhostEffectKind::Pure:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_fact_from_summary_result type_id operation summary
                SelfhostEffectKind::InternalAlloc:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_fact_from_summary_result type_id operation summary
                SelfhostEffectKind::PrivateState:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_transform_private_summary_result proofs type_id operation body_module_fingerprint body_root summary
                SelfhostEffectKind::PrivateCache:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_transform_private_summary_result proofs type_id operation body_module_fingerprint body_root summary
                SelfhostEffectKind::UnsafeMemory:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_fact_from_summary_result type_id operation summary
                SelfhostEffectKind::ExternalIo:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_fact_from_summary_result type_id operation summary
                SelfhostEffectKind::Nondet:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_fact_from_summary_result type_id operation summary

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_push_hir_root_result: HIR root 由来 fact を proof 適用後に table へ[追加/ついか]する
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `table` はこの関数が消費します。成功時は追加後の table owner を返します。
//: - effect checker が失敗した場合、`table` はまだ push に渡されていないため、この関数が必ず閉じます。
//: - table push が失敗した場合は、resolver table push が owner buffer を回収して閉じるため、この関数は二重解放しません。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_push_hir_root_result %impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable impure fn &SelfhostHirModule impure fn SelfhostTypeId impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationEvidenceKind impure fn i32 impure fn SelfhostHirExprId impure fn i32 impure fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofTable Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind \table\module\type_id\operation\body_module_fingerprint\root\fuel\proofs:
    match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_effect_check_result module root fuel:
        Result::Ok summary:
            match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_transform_summary_result proofs type_id operation body_module_fingerprint root summary:
                Result::Ok fact:
                    match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_table_push table fact:
                        Result::Ok next_table:
                            Result::Ok next_table
                        Result::Err table_error:
                            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind::OutputTableRejected table_error
                Result::Err e:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_table_free table
                    Result::Err e
        Result::Err effect_error:
            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_table_free table
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind::EffectCheckRejected effect_error

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_build_from_inputs_loop: build input table を proof gate 付きで[投入/とうにゅう]する
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_build_from_inputs_loop %impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable impure fn &SelfhostHirModule impure fn i32 impure fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFactBuildInputTable impure fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofTable impure fn i32 Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind \table\module\body_module_fingerprint\inputs\proofs\index:
    if:
        ge index selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_build_input_table_len inputs
        then:
            Result::Ok table
        else:
            let records %&Vec SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFactBuildInput field::get_ref inputs "records"
            match v::get records index:
                Option::Some input:
                    match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_push_hir_root_result table module input.type_id input.operation body_module_fingerprint input.root input.fuel proofs:
                        Result::Ok next_table:
                            selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_build_from_inputs_loop next_table module body_module_fingerprint inputs proofs add index 1
                        Result::Err e:
                            Result::Err e
                Option::None:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_table_free table
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind::InputReadFailed index

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_build_from_inputs_result: build input table から proof gate 済み method fact table を[作/つく]る
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_build_from_inputs_result %impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable impure fn &SelfhostHirModule impure fn i32 impure fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFactBuildInputTable impure fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofTable Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind \table\module\body_module_fingerprint\inputs\proofs:
    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_build_from_inputs_loop table module body_module_fingerprint inputs proofs 0

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_table_from_scan_records_result: scan record から proof gate 済み method fact table を[構築/こうちく]する
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `module`、`source`、`proofs` は borrow です。この関数は閉じません。
//: - `source` の method body root はすべて `module` と `body_module_fingerprint` に対応する同一 module 由来でなければなりません。複数 module の scan record を 1 table に混ぜる caller は、module ごとの table に分割してからこの関数を呼びます。
//: - scan が成功した場合、この関数は build input table owner を受け取り、success / failure のどちらでも閉じます。
//: - output fact table owner はこの関数が新規作成し、success の場合だけ caller に返します。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_table_from_scan_records_result %impure fn &SelfhostHirModule impure fn i32 impure fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyFactInputScanRecordTable impure fn &SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeProofTable Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind \module\body_module_fingerprint\source\proofs:
    match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_inputs_from_scan_records_result source:
        Result::Ok inputs:
            match selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_table_new:
                Result::Ok table:
                    let result %Result SelfhostMemoTraitOperationMethodBodyTable SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_build_from_inputs_result table module body_module_fingerprint &inputs proofs
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_build_input_table_free inputs
                    result
                Result::Err alloc_error:
                    selfhost_memo_trait_operation_method_body_fact_build_input_table_free inputs
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind::OutputTableAllocFailed alloc_error
        Result::Err scan_error:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitOperationPrivateEffectNoEscapeGateErrorKind::InputScanRejected scan_error

//: selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_std_error_kind_code: StdErrorKind を比較用 code へ[写/うつ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_operation_private_effect_no_escape_std_error_kind_code %fn StdErrorKind i32 \kind:
    match kind:
        StdErrorKind::Failure:
            0
        StdErrorKind::OutOfMemory:
            1
        StdErrorKind::EmptyCollection:
            2
        StdErrorKind::IndexOutOfBounds:
            3
        StdErrorKind::KeyNotFound:
            4
        StdErrorKind::CapacityExceeded:
            5
        StdErrorKind::InvalidOperation:
            6
        StdErrorKind::InvalidUtf8:
            7
        StdErrorKind::ParseError:
            8
        StdErrorKind::IoError:
            9
        StdErrorKind::Other:
            10

